  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">你喜歡玩殭屍末日遊戲嗎？當你想在一大群突變殭屍的圍攻下倖存時，會發生什麼事？活得越久，他們就越強大！因此，這個整合包就是為了這種生存體驗而設計的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">特色：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 血月事件每晚發生。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 於火車上求生。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 抵禦成群的殭屍及其變異體。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 新增槍械、武器與工具，提升生存體驗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">本整合包專為自訂地圖打造，可至雷奇喵愛發電平台下載：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fleqimiao\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.net/a/leqimiao</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">但即使沒有自訂地圖也能直接使用！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">關於火車主題的影片也可在我的 Bilibili 頻道觀看。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">你可以在 Bilibili 找到我的影片。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fb23.tv%252fv2vy9iS\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://b23.tv/v2vy9iS</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">注意：英文內容為純機器翻譯。Optifine 需自行手動下載。下載完成後，只需將 .jar 檔案複製至此執行個體的 Mods 資料夾內即可。</span></p>",
